                    1091.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If within 10 days of notification of the administrator in Step 1 the attempt at an informal resolution of the grievance is not successful and the grievant chooses to pursue the grievance, the grievant must file a formal grievance in writing with the supervisor.",
